Package: ml2165-rust
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: cups (>= 2.4), cups-filters, libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1 (>= 4.2)
Maintainer: CUPS Raster Filter Developer <caganergun@tutanota.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/caganerg/ml2165-rust
Description: CUPS raster filter for the Samsung ML-2165 printer
 rastertospl-rust converts the CUPS raster stream (RaSt/RaS2/RaS3) into the
 native SPL2 / QPDL v3 format spoken by the Samsung ML-2165 monochrome
 laser printer: PJL job envelope, 17-byte page header, Algo 0x11
 RLE-compressed band records and checksums. The printer is driven over USB;
 network and wireless models are out of scope.
 .
 The package ships the filter binary and the matching PPD. The filter is an
 ordinary glibc build that pulls in no third-party crates, so beyond the C
 runtime it needs nothing that Debian 13 (trixie) and Debian 14 do not already
 provide.
